IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ccc-core`

-- ccc30-forms-actors.l4 -- the one actor type that Forms 1 to 23 need and the core's `Party` lacks.
-- Many Forms address "(name of person)", "A.B." or "(name of financial institution, person or entity)": a person the Form orders, summons, demands of or
-- warns, who is neither the accused (core `the accused`), nor the offender, nor a witness. The core's `Party` cannot be extended from another module, so
-- this module declares a type of its own under the prefix `forms 1 to 23`; NEEDS-CORE.md records the constructor the lead may hoist into `Party`.
-- DECLARE only: no rule here.

§ `Forms 1 to 23 -- the person a demand, order or summons is addressed to`

@ref Criminal Code Forms 5.001 to 5.0091, 5.041 and 5.061 ("To (name of person)", "To A.B.", "To (name of person, financial institution or entity)")
DECLARE `forms 1 to 23 addressee` IS ONE OF
    `forms 1 to 23 the person to whom the demand, order or summons is addressed`
